Z||000019||Monkeyman||12-21-1999||01:12 PM||||The Delorean stopped being built because the president/CEO/whatever of the co (John Z. Delorean) got caught in a cocaine sting.  He spent all of his money on his defense and wasn't at the co to run it.  <P>I've seen a couple of painted Deloreans.  Good paint job, but ugly IMHO.  The only good thing about them was that they didn't get discolored (according to the owner).  If you don't know what I'm talking about, try putting some tree sap on a piece of SS for about 20 minutes.  It'll ruin it.  <P>And, no, I don't sleep.<P>BTW-John Z. will be making a new car.  But the only color available will be white.||||reg||1
