Z||000052||XenoGen||12-30-1999||11:05 AM||||Actually, I really liked the interior of the Pantera... I thought it was pretty neat, and a little different too. And neat logo on the floormat, if that's the logo for the Pantera.<P> 8 Tracks... Ah...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I still have a bunch... And a couple of players (they only kinda work.) Mopst of the labels of the 8 tracks have worn off.<P> Anywyas, speaking of interiors, here is a neat interior picture that I found - It's the interior of a kit Fiero... I don't really have info, and forget where I found it. It was on a web site that mentioned the Pirahna Kit Car for the Fiero, but the guy didn't have any more information on it. I think it's a real neat interior.<P> <IMG SRC="http://angelfire.com/mt/fierotech/fieroint.jpg"> <P>||||reg||10
